# are pure churn in history. `out/Titanium_candidate.txt` stays tracked because
# it is the canonical build output; the ti_* files are one-off CSE experiments
# (164 MB of them) with no reason to live in git.
out/ti_*.txt
out/Titanium_challenger.txt
out/Titanium_no_antitackle.txt
